#: src/components/health/SelfHealthTest.vue
msgid "This vehicle is running its \"factory\" version of BlueOS. This generally means something went wrong, and the system reverted to this version in order to recover. Please file an issue at <a href='https://github.com/bluerobotics/BlueOS/issues' target='_blank'>BlueOS/issues</a> or post on our <a href='https://discuss.bluerobotics.com/c/bluerobotics-software/blue-os/85' target='_blank'>forum</a>. Please include the <a href='#' class='js-download-logs'>System logs</a> if possible, and what you were doing when this happened."
msgstr "Dette fartøyet kjører «fabrikkversjonen» av BlueOS. Det betyr vanligvis at noe gikk galt, og at systemet gikk tilbake til denne versjonen for å gjenopprette seg. Opprett en sak på <a href='https://github.com/bluerobotics/BlueOS/issues' target='_blank'>BlueOS/issues</a> eller skriv et innlegg på <a href='https://discuss.bluerobotics.com/c/bluerobotics-software/blue-os/85' target='_blank'>forumet</a> vårt. Legg ved <a href='#' class='js-download-logs'>systemloggene</a> om mulig, og beskriv hva du gjorde da dette skjedde."

